<p><a href="https://www.carlowcollege.ie/Courses/Citizenship-and-Community-Studies/BA-Hons-in-Citizenship-and-Community-Studies" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer">PC405</a>– Social, Political and Community Studies (Level 8)</p>
<h3><a href="https://cit.ie" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer">Cork Institute of Technology</a></h3>
<p><a href="https://www.cit.ie/course/CR031" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer">CR031</a>– Social Care (Level 7)</p>
